cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite the snapshot (commit or edition) you used."
type: dataset
title: "ClaritX forward-tested AI stock-selection record"
authors:
  - name: "ClaritX Research Engine"
    website: "https://www.claritx.ai/research"
abstract: >-
  Pre-registered AI stock-selection strategies measured forward against a
  total-return S&P 500, with losing arms published. Daily series per arm,
  per-arm results, forward performance by AI score band, and archived nightly
  cohort snapshots from 2026-05-15 onward.
repository-code: "https://github.com/Orcules/claritx-forward-test"
url: "https://www.claritx.ai/research"
keywords:
  - forward test
  - stock selection
  - quantitative finance
  - AI stock scores
  - S&P 500
  - pre-registration
license: CC-BY-4.0
